This directory contains the files that build the Flyspeck project.

strictbuild.hl: goes through the build sequence, with error reporting.  It is
    loaded by ../../load_flyspeck.ml, the entry point of the project.

build.hl: List of project files used by strictbuild.hl.

checkpoint_flyspeck: builds a HOL Light image with the build sequence already
    loaded, through the make-checkpoint.sh of HOL Light.

use_serialization.hl: read by strictbuild.hl when FLYSPECK_SERIALIZATION is set.


